Z||000054||kel||11-30-1999||12:10 AM||||south central PA.<P>Sage,<P>Maybe you could contact the DMV and supply them with the VIN #, so they could track it and see if there is still a lien on the car and if they have the title to it.  If it was seized by the police, they should have done the paperwork notifying the state that it was seized and then hopefully you can apply for the title.  (Did they just "release" it to the tow guy?)  If the DMV is still showing a lien on it, I guess you're gonna have one BIG headache.  Good luck!           ||||reg||1
