Z||000058||RossT||11-30-1999||12:32 AM||||Hey Standard.  I hate to brag, but, my state is colder than your state!.  Ok all of you north of the border can brag even more.  Manatoba is the only place that I have seen<BR>where the cars have 3 or more electrical plug ins for the winter time.  one for the<BR>block heater, one for the battery warmer, and one called an in car heater that warms the inside of the car while it is parked and pluged in.<P>Today was the first day that I saw another gt in my town.  Unfortunatlly it had Michigan plates on it "HOCKEY9" was on the plates.<P>Ross||||reg||1
