Z||000063||DJRice||11-30-1999||08:35 AM||||Sage, <P>Try  <A HREF="http://www.carfax.com" TARGET=_blank>www.carfax.com</A>  if you havent already.  It will give you a complete title history and records if the vehicle was required to pass any yearly state inspections.  I used this service to do a background check on my Jeep before I bought it.  One VIN will cost $14.95 or you can get 2 months of unlimited VIN checking for $19.95.  That could be helpful in tracking down whoever has the title.<P>Also, you dont even need the fax machine because if you sign up on line it will display all the info on the screen for you to print.  Hope this helps you in your quest. ||||reg||4
