Z||000129||Bens88GT||05-05-2000||01:17 AM||||BigBoyToys,<BR>I've only had my 88GT for a few months. It's my first Fiero and has been quite a project. I don't want to add up all the parts and labor I've put into it. I know what you mean about not enough time.<BR>If you want to see a yellow Fiero in person, I'll be passing through Kingston a week from today (Friday) and coming back through on that Sunday. If you want to meet up or anything, click my profile for my email address.<BR>Kingston's a nice area to live. I grew up across the river, a little east of Rhinebeck.<P>-Ben||||reg||2
